It reads and writes the data of the PVOutput systems of the user through the
official PVOutput API (https://pvoutput.org/help/api_specification.html),
with the API key of the user's own account. PVOutput.org is a free service
run by its own authors; the data belong to the owners of the systems. This
integration is not affiliated with nor endorsed by PVOutput. The scope follows
the Home Assistant "PVOutput" integration (Apache-2.0); no code is taken from
it. The sunrise and sunset times follow the published equations of the NOAA
solar calculator (https://gml.noaa.gov/grad/solcalc/calcdetails.html).
